---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: h.log
---
@1000 conn#1 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#1: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#1 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#1: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#1 Welcome protocol=4
@1000 conn#1 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#1 SignInOptions [example] nonce="f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970"
@1000 conn#1 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #1: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970
@1000 sign-in #1 checked: https://id.example alice
   -> store #2: identity login example https://id.example alice
@1000 store answers #2: login ok, account 1 None
   -> event: conn#1: account 1 signed in with example
   -> send conn#1 SignedIn example:alice 8c79… (32 bytes)
@1000 conn#1 closed: the client left
   -> event: conn#1: closed: the client left
@1000 conn#2 accepted on game from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#2: accepted on game
@1000 conn#2 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#2: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#2 Welcome protocol=4
@1000 conn#2 sends TicketLogin example:alice 8c79… (32 bytes)
   -> event: conn#2: account 1 joined the game server
   -> store #3: load characters of 1
@1000 store answers #3: characters []
   -> send conn#2 Empire 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 1
   -> send conn#2 CharacterList []
@1000 conn#2 sends CreateCharacter slot=0 Alice class=0 empire=2
   -> store #4: create Alice for 1 in slot 0 at (60000, 156000) empire 2
@1000 store answers #4: created #1 Alice in slot 0
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 created
   -> send conn#2 CharacterCreated slot=0 #1 Alice class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
@1000 conn#2 sends SelectCharacter 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 2
   -> send conn#2 MainCharacter vid=1 Alice class=0 (60000, 156000) empire=2 group=0 run=450
   -> send conn#2 Points 1=1 4=300 5=796 6=796 7=304 8=304 12=6 13=4 14=3 15=3 16=4 17=100 18=14 19=150 20=4 27=1
@1000 conn#2 sends EnterGame
   -> send conn#2 Phase 3
   -> send conn#2 GameTime 1000
   -> send conn#2 Channel 1
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=1 (60000, 156000) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#2 EntityInfo vid=1 Alice empire=2 level=1
   -> send conn#2 Skills
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 entered as vid 1
@1000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "/help me"
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Unknown command help"
-- restarting and raising skills are no chat commands
@1000 conn#2 sends Restart town=false
@1000 conn#2 sends RaiseSkill 1
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Choose a skill group first: /skillgroup 1 or 2"
-- lines with control characters are dropped
@1000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "two\nlines"
-- talking to an entity that is not there does nothing
@1000 conn#2 sends Talk vid=99
-- a move kind that does not exist closes the connection
@1000 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=9 (0, 0)
   -> close conn#2
   -> store #5: save #1 at (60000, 156000) played 0s
   -> event: conn#2: closed: a move of an unknown kind
@1000 store answers #5: saved: Ok(())
